{
  "about": "FO4SF-Runtime.ini cases (FAL-246 item 2; FAL-247 native-launcher-contract). Each text is the file's UTF-8 content; ok cases give the Dir value the dlls use, refused cases a word their error must contain. sfse/FOCCSidecar/runtime_dir.h must meet every case (tests/test_sfse_runtime_dir.py), and so must the launcher's writer.",
